# ORENEX frontend — environment
#
# Base URL of the optional Python backend (../backend). When the app can reach
# /health here, the AI Copilot routes its answers through the Python engine and
# the header shows "PY ENGINE ONLINE"; otherwise it silently uses the local
# in-browser engine.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and adjust if needed. The default (when unset)
# is already http://127.0.0.1:8000.
VITE_ORENEX_API=http://127.0.0.1:8000
